# Units that follow a number, English. Fields: canonical name | dimension | surface forms, comma-separated | confidence (optional).
# A form starting with "=" is case-sensitive; the others are matched without regard to case. Forms may have several words ("miles per hour").
# Short forms that are also common words (in, a, at, am, min) are left out on purpose: a unit is only recognized right after a number.

[unit]
millimeter | length | mm, millimeter, millimeters, millimetre, millimetres
centimeter | length | cm, centimeter, centimeters, centimetre, centimetres
meter | length | =m, meter, meters, metre, metres
