micrometer | length | micron, microns, micrometer, micrometers, µm, μm
inch | length | inch, inches
foot | length | ft, foot, feet
yard | length | yd, yds, yard, yards
mile | length | mi, mile, miles
nautical mile | length | nautical mile, nautical miles, nmi

